{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02015.SBN#0001", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02015.SBN", "offset": 281, "capacity": 20, "raw_hex": "f0b3f0b4f7d12f2ffa64f151f18ef25df15a8148", "baseline_text": "홍란…//좀 진정됐어？", "kind": "ascr", "source": "紅蘭……//少しは落ちついた？", "pointer_offset": 240, "unit": "dialogue:713390c6a10d053a", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02015.SBN#0002", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02015.SBN", "offset": 310, "capacity": 30, "raw_hex": "f0aff0aff7d12f2ff0a6f0a7f8a8f24781432f2ff9aef273f274f0af8144", "baseline_text": "아아…//사쿠라 씨，//난 괜찮아．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "ああ……//さくらはん、//ウチは大丈夫や。", "pointer_offset": 244, "unit": "dialogue:1aeb2d0bc676c017", "prior_review": "이슈 #7: 홍란 경상도 사투리"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02015.SBN#0003", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02015.SBN", "offset": 351, "capacity": 60, "raw_hex": "f7d1f271f0f9f0b9f0f12f2ff0d8f27ef0f1f261f8a4f1daf0a2f1c781432f2ff0adf2c3f8c8f144f0a8f549fe59f14af1f5f8b9f1b5f276f0af8148", "baseline_text": "…모두에게//그렇게까지 들으면，//마음을 가라앉힐 수밖에 없잖아？", "kind": "ascr", "source": "……みんなに//あそこまで言われたら、//落ちつくしかないやろ？", "pointer_offset": 248, "unit": "dialogue:344dc9ed811d1b2d", "prior_review": "사투리 보강"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02015.SBN#0004", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02015.SBN", "offset": 412, "capacity": 26, "raw_hex": "f0ebf56ef0b4f7d12f2ff18ef2638143f1cff8f3f1c8f0f08144", "baseline_text": "동료란…//정말，좋은 거네．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "仲間って……//ホンマ、ええもんやね。", "pointer_offset": 252, "unit": "dialogue:9a465368e79debe0", "prior_review": "이슈 #7: 홍란 경상도 사투리"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02015.SBN#0005", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02015.SBN", "offset": 449, "capacity": 6, "raw_hex": "f0b3f0b4f7d1", "baseline_text": "홍란…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "紅蘭……", "pointer_offset": 256, "unit": "dialogue:d2c08771058b4911", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02015.SBN#0006", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02015.SBN", "offset": 458, "capacity": 58, "raw_hex": "f0d8f27ef0a4f1d48143f0b1f1a9f2aff157f7d12f2ff1bef14ff8b9f154f957f14ff27bf1daf0f32f2ff0aff8b2f16ff8f3f1c8f0b8f261f7d1", "baseline_text": "그렇지만，나한테는…//여기에 있는 기계들은//아이 같은 거니까…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "せやけど、ウチにとって……//ここにある機械は//子どもみたいなもんやから……", "pointer_offset": 260, "unit": "dialogue:d89a0cc2b7a8d663", "prior_review": "이슈 #7: 홍란 경상도 사투리"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02015.SBN#0007", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02015.SBN", "offset": 533, "capacity": 52, "raw_hex": "f99cf0e5f1daf0b9f0f12f2ff49df8c8fbb9f1d6f0a1f1daf0b9f74a81432f2ff2cef16af0a5f8f1f94bf265f148f29ef15a81b8", "baseline_text": "내 애들에게//손을 댄 녀석들에겐，//후회하게 해 줘야겠어∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "ウチの子どもたちに//手ぇ出した奴らには、//後悔させたらんとな∈", "pointer_offset": 264, "unit": "dialogue:e2a648071e802dac", "prior_review": "이슈 #7: 홍란 경상도 사투리"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02015.SBN#0008", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02015.SBN", "offset": 596, "capacity": 32, "raw_hex": "f0b3f0b4f8f4f360f7d12f2ff1e1f0af81b82f2ff0b1f8f4f0f4f1c6f0f181b8", "baseline_text": "홍란도 참…//맞아∈//나도 도울게∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "紅蘭ったら……//そうね！//あたしも手伝うわ∈", "pointer_offset": 268, "unit": "dialogue:3bd6924105d6727d", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02015.SBN#0009", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02015.SBN", "offset": 641, "capacity": 30, "raw_hex": "f1cff0af81b82f2ff0d8facaf0a6f0a7f8a8f24781432f2ff0c1f0cf81b8", "baseline_text": "좋아∈//그럼 사쿠라 씨，//간다∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "よっしゃ！//ほな、さくらはん、//いくでっ∈", "pointer_offset": 272, "unit": "dialogue:52324df9b1715d07", "prior_review": "이슈 #7: 홍란 경상도 사투리"}
